/yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Sandedbluepine.png (52 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sanded\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Sandedbluepine.png\" data-image-key=\"Sandedbluepine.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2a/Sandedbluepine.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/184?cb=20240326130333\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Sanded</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Plankedbluepine-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:183px; width:185px; top:1px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Plankedbluepine.png\" title=\"Plankedbluepine.png (59 KB)\" style=\"height:183px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3d/Plankedbluepine.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240326130352\" title=\"Plankedbluepine.png (59 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Plankedbluepine.png\" data-image-key=\"Plankedbluepine.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Plankedbluepine.png (59 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Plankedbluepine.png\" data-image-key=\"Plankedbluepine.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3d/Plankedbluepine.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240326130352\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Planked</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>It has the most branches out of all trees in the game.</li>\n<li>The leaves bear somewhat of a resemblance to <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Tree\" title=\"Magma Tree\"><b>Magma</b></a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Snow_tree\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snow tree\"><b>Snow</b></a> trees.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Blue Pine (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6Qmx1ZV9QaW5lP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></span> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Blue_Pine\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Blue_Pine?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" /></a><figcaption>Oaklands Wiki</figcaption></figure>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0; margin:0\">\n<table class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-radius:5px 5px 0 0; font-size:95